/Combat.Actions:
Each character or monster in combat has 3 Action Points. You can use these Action Points as you like, with no diminishing returns (e.g. you can attack 3 times with a one-handed weapon even).
Abilities that cost 0 Action Points are free and can be done as many times as you like.

Also, on your first Turn in Combat, you gain +1 Action Point for each 1 Initiative you have!

{Spell(Fire Ball)}

There is no such thing as a "minor-action", "bonus-action", etc.

